<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 8 }}>NETWORK + UI</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 24 }}>局域网开放 & Dify 可视化对话</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 26 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '24px 26px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 14 }}>
          <FAIcon name='network-wired' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F' }}>局域网开放</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1B2733', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", monospace', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
          # 编辑 ollama.service
          OLLAMA_HOST=0.0.0.0:11434
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 12 }}>
          其他机器即可访问你的模型服务——把本地模型变成团队共享能力。
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 14, padding: '24px 26px' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 14 }}>
          <FAIcon name='comments' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Dify 可视化</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
          · docker-compose 部署 Dify<br />
          · 配置模型供应商（Ollama）<br />
          · 创建聊天助手应用<br />
          · 接入 V4-Flash 开始对话
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 14, background: 'rgba(255,159,28,0.12)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '10px 14px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
            告别命令行，网页聊天
